{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787026536567677001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"upbeat-illadvised-springtail","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"5e1bf9d1d86362874ff7197a59bd17da8b7b4b4141020a77d108bc7bca837f8a","event_uuid":"03b6a530-40f4-4169-8f6a-165f3b8c8b65","position":{"commit_sha":"1fbf176ca5281699355900f704433853ca69ee57","position":"1787017356659244001-03b6a530-40f4-4169-8f6a-165f3b8c8b65"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"8a78109ae2aa44986978a115853b15004a7a5d94263d08ca7e86e7bef53d6d08","event_uuid":"5cf2eb05-1489-482b-9dea-3eb5ed8e2062","position":{"commit_sha":"8240e049f4aedc6794bb47d406ed6f5bd9923bd7","position":"1787017364693856001-5cf2eb05-1489-482b-9dea-3eb5ed8e2062"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787017356659244001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"5cf2eb05-1489-482b-9dea-3eb5ed8e2062","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"1d22-40ba-8e2b-4f67"}],"description":"## Context\nThe deprecation repair on dragonish-sylphic-sheep preserves rebar’s current Chat Completions wire behavior with the explicit `openai-chat:` prefix. Pydantic AI v2 makes the Responses API the default for `openai:`, so rebar should migrate deliberately after proving compatibility rather than inherit the semantic change implicitly.\n\n## Plan\n- Inventory every OpenAI and OpenAI-compatible endpoint, including custom base URLs, structured output, streaming, tool calls, retries, and provider-specific settings.\n- Define the supported Responses API contract and document any endpoints or features that remain Chat-Completions-only.\n- Add provider contract tests that compare current behavior with `openai-responses:` through production model construction.\n- Migrate eligible providers explicitly, add compatibility handling for ineligible custom endpoints, and document the operator-facing configuration change.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A provider capability matrix identifies each supported OpenAI-compatible endpoint as Responses-ready or Chat-Completions-only, with cited evidence.\n- [ ] Contract tests exercise real pydantic-ai model construction and assert structured output, streaming, tool-call, retry, and custom-base-URL behavior.\n- [ ] Eligible provider paths use `openai-responses:` explicitly; any retained `openai-chat:` path has a documented compatibility reason.\n- [ ] Configuration and migration documentation explain observable wire-semantic changes and rollback behavior.\n- [ ] Focused provider tests plus `make test`, `make lint`, and `make typecheck` pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["pydantic-ai","provider","migration"],"ticket_id":"155c-218b-c128-4700","ticket_type":"story","title":"Migrate OpenAI providers to the pydantic-ai Responses API","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["03b6a530-40f4-4169-8f6a-165f3b8c8b65","5cf2eb05-1489-482b-9dea-3eb5ed8e2062"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787026536567677001,"uuid":"506a47fe-f0eb-4933-8cbe-a2063582e4ef"}